# The anti-air mix, exactly as sweeps/duel-aa.txt measured it: three tanks to
# one hovertank, off the Land Factory production channel because the builder
# channel barely functions ([[policy-holding-ground]]). Worker ceiling 8 and
# mass 25 are the settled duel values.
#
# This is the control arm of the counter A/B: the mix is held as stated
# whatever the opponent fields.

name aa
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 0
cover 1
intercept 0
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
tech 0
